{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6f1c2a4-7d3e-4f8a-9c1b-2e5d6a7f8b90",
    "name": "Library Management API - Laravel 11 + Sanctum",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk RESTful API Sistem Perpustakaan (Library Management).\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan `php artisan serve` (default http://127.0.0.1:8000).\n2. Import file ini ke Postman.\n3. Jalankan request `Login` pada folder 1. Token Bearer otomatis disimpan ke collection variable `token`.\n4. Jalankan request CRUD pada folder 2.\n5. Folder 3 berisi skenario negatif (401) dan Logout.\n\nAkun demo: demo@library.test / password\n\nSemua request memakai Bearer Token melalui collection-level Authorization, kecuali Login (noauth) dan request negatif tanpa token.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "book_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "book_isbn",
      "value": "9780132350884",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_user_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication",
      "description": "Login untuk mendapatkan Bearer Token. Token disimpan otomatis ke collection variable `token`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Mengembalikan Bearer Token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Data user ikut dikembalikan', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.user.email).to.eql('demo@library.test');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Simpan token untuk request berikutnya.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_user_id', body.data.user.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"demo@library.test\",\n    \"password\": \"password\",\n    \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/login\n\nBody:\n- email (required)\n- password (required)\n- device_name (optional)\n\nRespons sukses: 200 OK berisi `data.token`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Mengembalikan user yang sedang login', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.email).to.eql('demo@library.test');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/me\n\nContoh endpoint terproteksi: membutuhkan header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Books (CRUD)",
      "description": "Seluruh request pada folder ini otomatis memakai Bearer Token dari collection variable `token`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Books",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Data buku berupa array', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.meta.total).to.eql(body.data.length);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/books\n\nMenampilkan seluruh daftar buku.\n\nFilter opsional: `?search=clean&category=Teknologi&status=available`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Book",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// ISBN unik setiap kali request dijalankan.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('book_isbn', '978' + Date.now().toString().slice(-10));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Buku berhasil dibuat dengan status available', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.title).to.eql('Clean Code');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql('available');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Simpan id buku baru untuk request Detail / Update / Delete.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('book_id', body.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Clean Code\",\n    \"author\": \"Robert C. Martin\",\n    \"isbn\": \"{{book_isbn}}\",\n    \"category\": \"Teknologi\",\n    \"status\": \"available\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/books\n\nRespons sukses: 201 Created.\nValidasi gagal (title/author kosong): 422 Unprocessable Content."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Book Detail",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Detail buku sesuai dengan book_id', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(String(body.data.id)).to.eql(String(pm.collectionVariables.get('book_id')));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books/{{book_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books",
                "{{book_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/books/{id}\n\nMenampilkan detail satu buku. Jika tidak ada: 404 Not Found."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Book (Borrowed)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status buku berubah menjadi borrowed', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.status).to.eql('borrowed');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Clean Code (Edisi Revisi)\",\n    \"status\": \"borrowed\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books/{{book_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books",
                "{{book_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "PUT /api/books/{id}\n\nMengubah data dan/atau status buku (available <-> borrowed)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Book",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Buku berhasil dihapus', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(String(body.data.id)).to.eql(String(pm.collectionVariables.get('book_id')));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books/{{book_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books",
                "{{book_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "DELETE /api/books/{id}\n\nMenghapus buku. Hanya user pemilik buku (user_id) yang diizinkan; selain itu 403 Forbidden."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Negative Scenarios & Logout",
      "description": "Contoh skenario Bearer Token tidak disertakan / tidak valid (401) dan proses logout.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Books Without Token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Pesan error dalam format JSON', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.message).to.include('Unauthenticated');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/books tanpa header Authorization.\n\nRespons: 401 Unauthorized (JSON)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Books With Invalid Token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "token-tidak-valid",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/books",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "books"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/books dengan Bearer Token palsu.\n\nRespons: 401 Unauthorized (JSON)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Token berhasil dicabut', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.message).to.include('Logout berhasil');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Token sudah tidak berlaku; kosongkan variable agar jelas.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('token');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/logout\n\nMencabut token yang sedang dipakai. Setelah ini, jalankan Login lagi untuk mengakses endpoint terproteksi."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
